<BR></FONT><FONT SIZE=2><B>SUMMARY    <BR>  </B></FONT></P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT><FONT SIZE=2><I>This summary highlights information contained elsewhere in this prospectus. This summary does not contain all of the information that you
should consider before investing in the units. You should read this entire prospectus carefully, including the risk factors beginning on page&nbsp;9. See the glossary in Appendix&nbsp;E for
