<P><FONT SIZE=2><B><I>Each trading advisor advises other clients and may achieve more favorable results for its other accounts as compared to the Fund.  </I></B></FONT></P>


<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each of the trading advisors currently manages other trading accounts, and each will remain free to manage additional accounts, including its own accounts, in the
future. A trading advisor may vary the trading strategies applicable to the Fund from those used for its other managed accounts, or its other managed accounts may impose a different cost structure
