<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A
trading advisor may also have a financial incentive to favor other accounts because the compensation received from those other accounts exceeds, or may in the future exceed, the
compensation that it receives from managing the Fund's account. Because records with respect to other accounts are not accessible to investors in the Fund, investors will not be able to determine if
