<P><FONT SIZE=2><B><I>An unanticipated number of redemption requests during a short period of time could have an adverse effect on the net asset value of the Fund.  </I></B></FONT></P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If a substantial number of requests for redemption are received by the Fund during a relatively short period of time, the Fund may not be able to satisfy the
