<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In
addition to its Global Diversified Program, Graham currently trades the following futures programs: Graham Selective Trading Program, K4 Program, Proprietary Matrix Program,
