<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Fund's returns, which are the Fund's trading gains plus interest income less brokerage fees, performance fees, operating costs and offering costs borne by the
Fund, for the twelve months ended December&nbsp;31, 2002 and the two years ended December&nbsp;31, 2001 and 2000 were approximately 15.3%, 7.0%, and 11.0%. The net asset value at
December&nbsp;31, 2002 was approximately $14.6&nbsp;million and at December&nbsp;31, 2001 and 2000 was approximately $11.6&nbsp;million and $12.1&nbsp;million. </FONT></P>


