<P><FONT SIZE=2><I> Stock Indices  </I></FONT></P>

</UL>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Fund's primary equity exposure is to equity price risk in the G-7 countries as well as other countries including Hong Kong, Taiwan, and Australia.
