<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;UBS PaineWebber is also acting as a selling agent for the Fund, which could give rise to a conflict of interest because its compensation as clearing broker and
