<P><FONT SIZE=2><B>CONFLICTS OF INTEREST  </B></FONT></P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Some of the parties involved with the operation and/or management of the Fund, including the general partner, have other relationships that may create
disincentives to act in the best interests of the Fund and its limited partners. The general partner has not established, and has no plans to establish, any procedures or controls to prevent, address
