<P><FONT SIZE=2><B>Nature of Classes and Determination of Net Asset Value  </B></FONT></P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Fund is organized into two separate classes of limited partnership units, Class&nbsp;A limited partnership units and Class&nbsp;B limited partnership
