<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The
terms "net asset value" or "net assets" as of any date with respect to any class of units refer to (1)&nbsp;the total assets of the Fund constituting such class as of such date
