<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each
class shall share in the assets, expenses and liabilities of the Fund on a proportional basis with each other class, except to the extent otherwise specifically provided in the
