<P><FONT SIZE=2><B>Liability of Limited Partners  </B></FONT></P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;When purchased in this offering, units will be fully paid and nonassessable. A limited partner will be liable for the losses and obligations of the Fund only to
the extent of its capital contribution and any share of undistributed profits. Once a limited partner has caused the Fund to redeem its units, the Fund may have a claim against that limited partner
for liabilities of the Fund that arose before the date of redemption, but the claim will not exceed the limited partner's capital contribution and share of undistributed profits together with
interest. The Fund will make a claim against a limited partner only in the event that assets of the Fund are insufficient to discharge the Fund's liabilities to its creditors. The general partner will
